-- title:
--   Place above j(τ₀) fixed by stabiliser automorphisms
-- statement:
--   Fix $N \geq 1$ and let $A_N =$ [`ModularCurve.LevelN.ring N`](def/ModularCurve_LevelNFunctionField.html#L28) be the $\mathbb{C}$-subalgebra of functions $\mathfrak{H} \to \mathbb{C}$ generated by the set consisting of $j = E_4^3/\Delta$ (the function `jAnalytic`) together with the functions `fricke N v` for nonzero $v \in (\mathbb{Z}/N)^2$. Let $K$ be a field that is simultaneously a $\mathbb{C}$-algebra and an $A_N$-algebra, compatibly (scalar tower), and a fraction field of $A_N$, and let $\tau_0 \in \mathfrak{H}$. Then there exists a place $W$ of $K$ over $\mathbb{C}$ in the sense of the project, that is, a valuation subring of $K$ containing the image of $\mathbb{C}$, distinct from $K$ itself and a principal ideal ring, such that: first, the order function of $W$ (minus the logarithm of the associated adic valuation) is strictly positive on the element $j - j(\tau_0)$, i.e. on the difference of the image in $K$ of `jGen N` and the image of the scalar `jAnalytic τ₀`; and second, for every $\gamma \in \mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z})$ with $\gamma \cdot \tau_0 = \tau_0$, every witness that $A_N$ is stable under $F \mapsto F \circ \gamma^{-1}$, and every $\mathbb{C}$-algebra automorphism $\varphi$ of $K$ which sends the image of each $F \in A_N$ to the image of $F \circ \gamma^{-1}$, the semilinear automorphism $(\varphi, \mathrm{id}_{\mathbb{C}})$ attached to $\varphi$ fixes $W$ for the pointwise action on places.
--
--   This produces the place of the level-$N$ modular function field given by the order of vanishing at a point $\tau_0$ of the upper half plane, lying above the point $j = j(\tau_0)$ of the $j$-line and invariant under the automorphisms of $K$ induced by elements of the stabiliser of $\tau_0$ in $\mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z})$. It feeds the ramification and fibre-counting arguments [`ModularCurve.LevelN.twelve_mul_add_mul_index_le_genusFF`](thm.html#ModularCurve.LevelN.twelve_mul_add_mul_index_le_genusFF), [`ModularCurve.natCard_doubleCoset_le_card_fibres_of_finrank_eq_index`](thm.html#ModularCurve.natCard_doubleCoset_le_card_fibres_of_finrank_eq_index) and [`ModularCurve.natCard_fibres_jqModC_eq_natCard_doubleCoset_of_finrank_eq_index`](thm.html#ModularCurve.natCard_fibres_jqModC_eq_natCard_doubleCoset_of_finrank_eq_index).
